{
  "name": "dsh-te-prune",
  "version": "0.2.1",
  "description": "Evidence-driven tool-set pruning across sessions (opt-in), with /te-prune. · 跨会话按证据隐藏闲置工具（默认关闭），命令 /te-prune。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
